f:["$","div",null,{"className":"my-6 flex gap-3 rounded-xl border px-5 py-4 border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-50/60 text-foreground dark:bg-amber-500/10","role":"alert","children":[["$","svg",null,{"width":"20","height":"20","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"1.75","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M12 9v4m0 4h.01M10.29 3.86 1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0Z"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex-1 [&>p]:my-0 [&>p+p]:mt-2","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-1 font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]","children":"`inner_store` is a barrier, not a getter"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["It is how a caller resolves an optimization (\"can I hardlink this?\")\nthrough a stack of wrappers. A routing wrapper forwards it; a wrapper that\nchanges the bytes must return ",["$","code",null,{"children":"self"}],", because what is underneath is not the\nblob. Getting this wrong is a ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"runtime"}]," error, not a compile error: the\ntrait checks with ",["$","code",null,{"children":"addr_eq"}]," and fires an ",["$","code",null,{"children":"error_if!"}]," if a store returns\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"self"}]," while advertising an optimization it cannot honour. ",["$","$L49",null,{"href":"/explanations/store-model","children":"The store\nmodel"}]," covers the semantics from the operator's\nside."]}]]}]]}]
10:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","code",null,{"children":"StoreKey"}]," is a two-variant enum, ",["$","code",null,{"children":"Str"}]," or ",["$","code",null,{"children":"Digest"}],", with a variant-salted\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"Hash"}]," so that a string key and a digest key cannot collide."]}]
11:["$","p",null,{"children":["Register health with the ",["$","code",null,{"children":"default_health_status_indicator!(YourType);"}],"\nmacro as the last line of the file, unless the store has something real to\nreport. Health checks across all components run ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"concurrently"}],"\n(",["$","code",null,{"children":"buffer_unordered(usize::MAX)"}],"), with a comment in"]}]
