17:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","code",null,{"children":"Code"}]," ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"is"}]," ",["$","code",null,{"children":"tonic::Code"}],", re-exported from\n",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://github.com/toxicwind/forge/blob/v1.6.5/forge-error/src/lib.rs","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","data-source-link":"forge-error/src/lib.rs","data-source-ref":"v1.6.5","title":"forge-error/src/lib.rs at v1.6.5","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md border border-border bg-surface-elevated px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground no-underline transition-colors hover:border-brand/50 hover:text-brand","children":[["$","svg",null,{"width":"12","height":"12","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"m16 18 6-6-6-6M8 6l-6 6 6 6"}]}],"Error"]}],".\nNo separate internal code enum and no mapping layer exist, which is why\nan error raised deep in a store arrives at a client with a sensible gRPC\nstatus without anyone writing a conversion."]}]
18:["$","p",null,{"children":["An ",["$","code",null,{"children":"Error"}]," carries a code, a ",["$","strong",null,{"children":[["$","code",null,{"children":"Vec<String>"}]," of messages"]}],", and a context.\nThe messages are a stack, joined with ",["$","code",null,{"children":"\" : \""}]," when displayed. This is the\nwhole point of the model: each layer appends what it was trying to do, so\nthe final message reads outside-in."]}]
