1f:["$","p",null,{"children":["The Tokio runtime is built by hand in ",["$","code",null,{"children":"main()"}],", not with ",["$","code",null,{"children":"#[tokio::main]"}],":\nthe builder installs an ",["$","code",null,{"children":"on_thread_start"}]," hook (macOS QoS), and the process\nsignal handlers and the shutdown broadcast are spawned onto it before\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"inner_main"}]," runs. Each of those calls carries an\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"#[expect(clippy::disallowed_methods, reason = …)]"}],", because the same lint\nthat bans ",["$","code",null,{"children":"tokio::spawn"}]," everywhere else bans the runtime builder too."]}]
